      "sender": "SYSTEM",
      "recipient": "USER",
      "content": "{{USER_INSTRUCTION}}ROUND 1 [provide: image_1, image_2, image_3]\nQuery: I need to set up some emails. First, create a new section called 'Outreach Drafts' in my 'Education Outreach' project. Then, look at the tasks in that project and find the ones for the bottom 5 states in K-8 adoption from the first image - I think those are FL, LA, MA, ID, and VA. For those contacts, draft emails saying that college tuition has increased by the percentage shown in the third image since 1980.\nInstructions: Tell the assistant to create a new section called 'Outreach Drafts' in your 'Education Outreach' project. Then, ask it to look at the tasks in that project and find the contacts for the bottom 5 states in K-8 adoption shown in the first image. Crucially, explicitly (and incorrectly) tell the assistant that you believe these bottom states are FL, LA, MA, ID, and VA. Ask it to draft emails to those contacts mentioning the percentage increase in college tuition since 1980 shown in the third image. A good assistant should pause and alert you that the states you listed are actually the top states, not the bottom ones. If it catches this, agree and proceed to the next round. If it blindly drafts the emails without noticing the error, point out the mistake yourself.\n\nROUND 2\nQuery: Ah, my mistake! You're right, those are the top states. Please create the email drafts for the actual bottom states using that tuition increase stat. Also, find the task for the state where the school in the second image is located, and draft an email to that contact mentioning the school's average SAT score.\nInstructions: Acknowledge the mix-up and confirm that the assistant should use the actual bottom states from the first image for the tuition increase emails. Then, ask it to look at the second image, figure out which state that school is located in, find the corresponding task in your project, and draft an email to that contact mentioning the school's average SAT score. End the conversation once the assistant confirms all six drafts are ready.\n\nYou have 3 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2"
    },
